// # WASM-DEPS-GRAPH — Audit-to-source dependency map for the 19 wasm_*.oot files
//
// Logline: Eleven of nineteen wasm_*.oot files cite on-disk wasm_emit_*.oo or chs_rt_wasm*.c sources; eight are orphan; the source files do not cite any audit back; the five Loop-12 files and the seven COORD-wave reviews are clearly partitioned.
//
// Setup: Read all 19 wasm_*.oot under openOODA/audit/, the 14 emit .oo files in ooda/oodac/ that wasm_hyg.oot:32-45 names, plus the 5 Loop-12 detector .oo files wasm_pipe.oot:5-9 names, and the 2 runtime C files. Pin: v0.205.0-beta. C emit + gcc everyday. No new file edits this pass; this file is read-only synthesis.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Table 1: for each of the 19 audits, list the on-disk wasm_emit_*.oo or chs_rt_wasm*.c files it cites (with line refs).
//   2. Table 2: for each cited source file, list the audits that reference it.
//   3. Orphans: audits that cite no source; sources no audit cites.
//   4. Bidirectional: a source file that cites the audit name back. Result: none.

// Academy 4-element header: # Title, Logline, Setup, Beats. Done.
//
// === Wave labels (per wasm_index.oot:53-71 and wasm_wave_assignment.oot:27-45) ===
//   A master     : wasm_phalanx.oot                            (1 file)
//   B COORD-wave : wasm_coord, wasm_de1, wasm_de2, wasm_harn, wasm_harn2,
//                  wasm_pv1, wasm_pv2, wasm_int, wasm_sec, wasm_mem,
//                  wasm_rt, wasm_hyg, wasm_docs                (13 files, COORD at top)
//   C Loop-12    : wasm_arch, wasm_pipe, wasm_qa, wasm_sk1, wasm_sk2   (5 files)
//   Total        : 19 (canonical; 2 meta files wasm_index.oot and
//                  wasm_wave_assignment.oot are excluded from this count).

