// Loop-12 (Wave C, 5 files). All five are CONST-PRINT fold notes.
//   wasm_arch.oot    5-fold summary            (no path citations; orphan)
//   wasm_pipe.oot    5 detector .oo citations  :5-9
//   wasm_qa.oot      5 hits + 5 hostiles       (fixture names; orphan)
//   wasm_sk1.oot     false-fold hunt           (function names; orphan)
//   wasm_sk2.oot     isolation seal + 5 detector .oo citations :16-17
// Detectors cited (5 of 90 on-disk emit files): wasm_emit_seventeen.oo,
//   wasm_emit_ifpneqne.oo, wasm_emit_ifneqorne.oo, wasm_emit_ifpneqandne.oo,
//   wasm_emit_ifltandne.oo.
// Of the 5 Loop-12 audits, 2 cite source (pipe, sk2). 3 are orphan (arch, qa, sk1).
//
// COORD-wave (Wave B, 13 files). All thirteen are reviews or re-confirmations
// of an EXISTING print fold, runtime, or process fact.
//   wasm_coord.oot   wave plan  (5 source files)
//   wasm_de1.oot     re-read wasm_emit_fold.oo
//   wasm_de2.oot     re-read wasm_emit_two.oo + wasm_emit_int.oo
//   wasm_harn.oot    if-true fixture review     (orphan)
//   wasm_harn2.oot   if-false fixture review    (orphan)
//   wasm_pv1.oot     hostile IDENT if review    (cites wasm_emit_if.oo)
//   wasm_pv2.oot     board honesty check        (orphan)
//   wasm_int.oot     product binary integration (orphan)
//   wasm_sec.oot     ovf latch + check gate     (cites both C files)
//   wasm_mem.oot     buf 30k ERR                (cites both C files)
//   wasm_rt.oot      dummy 02 00 0b + fd_write  (cites both C files)
//   wasm_hyg.oot     line counts                (cites 14 emit + both C)
//   wasm_docs.oot    board sentences            (orphan)
// Of 13 COORD-wave audits, 8 cite source (coord, de1, de2, pv1, sec, mem, rt, hyg).
// 5 are orphan (harn, harn2, pv2, int, docs).
//
// Master (Wave A, 1 file):
//   wasm_phalanx.oot   12-role master plan (cites 5 emit + both C files).
//
// Crossover: zero Loop-12 audit cites a COORD-wave source. Zero COORD-wave
// audit cites a Loop-12 detector. The two waves share NO source file in
// Table 1. Disjoint on the source axis.

